Tester box 58942, threads 51948-49: the server's line said the named person is not on Netai and nothing was sent, but the conversation was already a goal, so statusAfterRun kept it at „ველოდები პასუხს“. The run now records that its server line sent nothing (not on Netai, excluded, or not sent at all), the result carries ownerDecidesNext, and statusAfterRun gives needs_you unless an ask or introduction is still out with someone else. The never-opened line is unchanged: its buttons already make it needs_you.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
